---
import assets from '../data/demo-assets.json';
import { manufacturerLinks } from '../data/future-content';
---
<section class="future-v1__proof" aria-labelledby="future-proof-title">
  <div class="future-v1__proof-local"><span class="future-v1__proof-label">Local</span><h2 id="future-proof-title">A local company with a direct line to the job.</h2><p>East Coast Foam is locally owned and operated. Learn more about the business, equipment, and service approach.</p><a href="/future/about">Meet East Coast Foam <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  <div class="future-v1__proof-materials"><span class="future-v1__proof-label">Materials</span><p>Materials from established industry manufacturers.</p><div>{manufacturerLinks.map((brand) => <a href={brand.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src={(assets.brandLogos as Record<string, string>)[brand.name]} alt={brand.name} loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" /></a>)}</div><a href="/future/about">See material context <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
</section>
